        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_14077.txt",
        "text_sha256": "5f3a90e69a85ef63bcf4feb8b38ec566993c1999075b65fd00a5440182b62b17",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2022-07-20/pdf/2022-15628.pdf"
      },
      "text": "Section 1. Establishment of Emergency Board (Board). There is established, \neffective 12:01 a.m. eastern daylight time on July 18, 2022, a Board composed \nof a chair and two other members, all of whom shall be appointed by \nthe President to investigate and report on these disputes. No member shall \nbe pecuniarily or otherwise interested in any organization of railroad employ-\nees or any carrier. The Board shall perform its functions subject to the \navailability of funds."
    },
    {
      "char_end": 2418,
      "char_start": 2301,
      "id": "CLAUSES:EO:14077#sec2",
      "kind": "section",
      "label": "Sec. 2.",
      "pdf_page": 1,
      "scope_id": "EO:14077#sec2",
      "source": {
        "filing_date": null,
        "location_confidence": "high",
        "location_verified": false,
        "page_or_item": "87 FR 43203, PDF pages 1-5",
        "requires_page_check": false,
        "sha256": "3a805d9ddb52415c641ccc520daca2365d08d241fd8490f0b1ae35ca4eabea24",
        "signing_date": "2022-07-15",
        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_14077.txt",
        "text_sha256": "5f3a90e69a85ef63bcf4feb8b38ec566993c1999075b65fd00a5440182b62b17",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2022-07-20/pdf/2022-15628.pdf"
      },
      "text": "Sec. 2. Report. The Board shall report to the President with respect to \nthe disputes within 30 days of its creation."
    },
    {
      "char_end": 2756,
      "char_start": 2420,
      "id": "CLAUSES:EO:14077#sec3",
      "kind": "section",
      "label": "Sec. 3.",
      "pdf_page": 1,
      "scope_id": "EO:14077#sec3",
      "source": {
        "filing_date": null,
        "location_confidence": "high",
        "location_verified": false,
        "page_or_item": "87 FR 43203, PDF pages 1-5",
        "requires_page_check": false,
        "sha256": "3a805d9ddb52415c641ccc520daca2365d08d241fd8490f0b1ae35ca4eabea24",
        "signing_date": "2022-07-15",
        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_14077.txt",
        "text_sha256": "5f3a90e69a85ef63bcf4feb8b38ec566993c1999075b65fd00a5440182b62b17",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2022-07-20/pdf/2022-15628.pdf"
      },
      "text": "Sec. 3. Maintaining Conditions. As provided by section 10 of the RLA, \nfrom the date of the creation of the Board and for 30 days after the Board \nhas submitted its report to the President, no change in the conditions out \nof which the disputes arose shall be made by the parties to the controversy, \nexcept by agreement of the parties."
    },
    {
      "char_end": 3250,
