        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2022-07-20/pdf/2022-15628.pdf"
      },
      "text": "Sec. 4. Records Maintenance. The records and files of the Board are records \nof the Office of the President and upon the Board’s termination shall be \nmaintained in the physical custody of the National Mediation Board. \nVerDate Sep<11>2014 15:37 Jul 19, 2022 Jkt 256250 PO 00000 Frm 00001 Fmt 4705 Sfmt 4790 E:\\FR\\FM\\20JYE0.SGM 20JYE0khammond on DSKJM1Z7X2PROD with PRESDOC3\n=== PDF page 2 of 5 ===\n43204 Federal Register / Vol. 87, No. 138 / Wednesday, July 20, 2022 / Presidential Documents"
    },
